🧭 Overview
The meeting aligned the existing Multifamily deployment capabilities with the standard MDTC V2 pipeline and separated the immediate development path from production compliance work. The agreed approach is to reuse existing Artifactory-to-S3, IC deployer, and AWS pipeline capabilities where feasible, while validating and transforming the required CloudFormation Templates (CFTs) for Freddy Mac production governance.
The Shared Library pipeline will build and scan application artifacts, including the 45 FOS scan, and promote successful packages to JFrog artifactory; the IAC V2 pipeline will retrieve CFTs from Bitbucket and artifacts from Artifactory, promote them to S3, and execute the CloudFormation deployment.
